	"system": {
		"description": {
			"value": "<p><em>Whether by birth, ritual, or accident, you are infused with powers from the &amp;reference[elemental] plane of water. Magic comes to you easily, and you have greater control over elemental water than any other.</em></p><table><caption><p>The Water Savant</p></caption><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\"><p>Level</p></th><th scope=\"col\"><p>Features</p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><p>3</p></td><td><p>Empowered Cantrips: <em>@UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-spells.Item.2iAvXOuVvQ5kwqAa]{Acid Splash}</em>, <em>@UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-spells.Item.3wT0BXLrGDEtFkUP]{Ray of Frost}</em></p></td></tr><tr><td><p>3</p></td><td><p>@UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-class-features.Item.F7uDmYfklTlsEpM3]{Relentless Tides}</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>6</p></td><td><p>@UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-class-features.Item.Rflf9EinzdNkndMx]{&amp;reference[elemental] Infusion}</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>10</p></td><td><p>@UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-class-features.Item.LzPBkZqEQZ5tK8cl]{Ascendant Water}</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>14</p></td><td><p>@UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-class-features.Item.oNeC570kIhfmFilC]{Water &amp;reference[elemental] Form}</p></td></tr></tbody></table><table><caption><p>Expanded Spell List</p></caption><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\"><p>Sorcerer Level</p></th><th scope=\"col\"><p>Extra Spells</p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p><em>@UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-spells.Item.LSj5f6kAbJTudeg3]{Gentle Current}</em></p></td></tr><tr><td><p>3</p></td><td><p><em>@UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-spells.Item.G9eZpeJG2YxIAPri]{Crushing Wave}</em></p></td></tr><tr><td><p>5</p></td><td><p><em>@UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-spells.Item.SS4bImfG74wnGnwt]{Touch of Corrosion}</em></p></td></tr><tr><td><p>7</p></td><td><p><em>@UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-spells.Item.gNFMj9wf8ZpfSCDd]{Ice Storm}</em></p></td></tr><tr><td><p>9</p></td><td><p><em>@UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-spells.Item.zfFvSNcyrjbcDeEJ]{Cone of Cold}</em></p>