				"title": "Aquan Speech",
				"hint": "You learn the primordial language. You can read and write primordial and understand all spoken dialects of primordial. You can also use minor elemental magics to speak like a water elemental.\n\nYou can move water rapidly through the air, recreating the rushing and bubbling sounds a water elemental makes to speak the Aquan dialect of primordial."
