						"conditions": "{}",
						"replacement": "",
						"key": "system.description.value",
						"type": "override",
						"value": "<p><em>Pointing at a creature you can see, a beam of frigid air strikes out towards your target.</em></p><p><strong>Ranged Spell Attack</strong></p><ul><li><p><strong>Hit:</strong> [[/damage 1d10 cold]] damage* and target's speeds are reduced by 10.</p></li><li><p>You can also freeze a 5 ft. cube of water with this spell. If a creature is inside the cube, the ice fails to form.</p></li></ul><p><strong>*At Higher Levels:</strong> This spell's damage increases by [[/damage 1d10 cold]] when you reach a total character or creature level of 5th level ([[/damage 2d10 cold]]), 11th level ([[/damage 3d10 cold]]), and 17th level ([[/damage 4d10 cold]] ).</p>"
